    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3455" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρηθής:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄψεκτπς</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρήμορον:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστεργές</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρήπεδος:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀγαθή</span> (sc.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρής</span></b> ,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dumb with astonishment</i>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρηστής:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοῦλος</span>, Id.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκριστιν</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρῆστις:</span></b> <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάχις,
				καὶ ἄκρα</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρηστόλουχος:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοῦλος</span>, Id.</div>
